{"data":[{"author_id":"1996551578187436033","created_at":"2026-10-19T07:45:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112087612802335065"],"id":"2112087612802335065","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":403,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📊 盘后看点 | 10.19：沪指低开高走，科创50独自承压\n\n早报算完了GDP的账，午间拆了AI硬件\"高切低\"，这篇对账到收盘：全天1.44万亿，沪指红盘、科创50跌超2%，分化不是收敛，而是走到了极致。\n\n【收盘成绩单】","url":"https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2112087612802335065"},{"author_id":"2108191189019381760","created_at":"2026-10-19T05:55:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112060153256423810"],"id":"2112060153256423810","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":74,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📌高盛中国午盘\n\n💡上证综指 +0.16%，科创 50 -1.68%。\n💡上证 50 +0.29%，创业板指 -1.07%。\n💡沪深 300 +0.09%，中证 500 -0.14%。\n💡A 股总成交额（万亿人民币）0.98。\n\n💡受区域市场波动加剧影响，中国股市低开，但至午间收盘前成功收窄跌幅。","url":"https://x.com/2030FY_X/status/2112060153256423810"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111716702656626688"]},"author_id":"2105582591122583552","created_at":"2026-10-18T07:11:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111716732540944418"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/a6IN9bpJqm","end":71,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/HDchengzhu/status/2111716732540944418/photo/1","media_key":"3_2111716702656626688","start":48,"url":"https://t.co/a6IN9bpJqm"}]},"id":"2111716732540944418","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【每经：市场走到这里 短期其实不必放大悲观 当万得全A出现周线4连阴 往往意味着反弹已经不远】 https://t.co/a6IN9bpJqm","url":"https://x.com/HDchengzhu/status/2111716732540944418"},{"author_id":"2035018650965745664","created_at":"2026-10-18T14:49:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111831248138060111","2111831967000035368"],"id":"2111831967000035368","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1158,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"周五纳指大跌2.15，网传的救市措